{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/e2788b8779e2af1dbfcbf8eddc984316.poster.avif?t=1752243993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/e2788b8779e2af1dbfcbf8eddc984316.webm?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/e2788b8779e2af1dbfcbf8eddc984316.mp4?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo coming soon! Wishlist the game to get notified!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>CONQUER EACH FLOOR</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, Blast, and Dodge your way up the tower with over 100+ unique spells. Each spell has a unique form and plays differently than the last. Whether you're freezing enemies with a glacial spike, or hurling meteors down on your foes, master them to melt through enemies and climb even higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/BullethellGif.gif?t=1752243993\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <u><strong>BECOME SUPER POWERFUL</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrading a spell isn\u2019t just a stat boost, it\u2019s a transformation. Each upgrade reshapes the spell into something stronger, flashier, and way more fun. With most spells evolving across three tiers, you\u2019re free to go 'all-in' on your favorites, and unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.poster.avif?t=1752243993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.webm?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.mp4?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <strong> <u>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BUILD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it's a new class, pet, perk, mask, or cosmetic, there are thousands of combinations to make each and every run feel fresh.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/38e8396fc64edd755b2edc111485525f.poster.avif?t=1752243993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/38e8396fc64edd755b2edc111485525f.webm?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/38e8396fc64edd755b2edc111485525f.mp4?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>DISCOVER</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock various NPC's that aid you on your path.\u00a0Seek out forgotten chambers, sacred masks, and powerful boss runes, each one pulsing with power and waiting to reshape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/207ddf10a983349a991794ee752c59be.poster.avif?t=1752243993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/207ddf10a983349a991794ee752c59be.webm?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/207ddf10a983349a991794ee752c59be.mp4?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>FACE THE CHALLENGE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the guardians of the tower in EPIC boss battles! Do you have what it takes to come out on top?<br>\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/0312c7f534dc9be2162bb0791832e17e.poster.avif?t=1752243993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/0312c7f534dc9be2162bb0791832e17e.webm?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/0312c7f534dc9be2162bb0791832e17e.mp4?t=1752243993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  <strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play your way, with several unique classes to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ unique spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face dozens of enemy types and super challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Spell Upgrade System that <i><u>isn't</u></i> just a number increase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore many diverse biomes each filled with new dangerous enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level-Up and assign stat points to further shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover NPC's in the tower that will help you face even greater threats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of unique perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of Pet Companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loads of Cosmetics that unlock via achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find masks with unique abilities which will surely shake up your current run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Gacha <i><u>without</u></i> microtransactions. (In-game currency only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss perks! - After defeating a boss, choose an additional perk to help you climb higher.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand Designed floors with randomized twists to keep every run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Status Effects Galore - Freeze, burn, stun, and poison. Show those enemies who's boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shops!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty options to tailor each run to your skill and mood.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3189770?t=1752243993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/a743a354675789c9441107a7f1459f02a44d8f3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752243993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/0db0b1000d498246cabae381e0e89749332316f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752243993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/0db0b1000d498246cabae381e0e89749332316f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752243993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"