/p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of Pet Companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loads of Cosmetics that unlock via achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find masks with unique abilities which will surely shake up your current run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Gacha <i><u>without</u></i> microtransactions. (In-game currency only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss perks! - After defeating a boss, choose an additional perk to help you climb higher.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand Designed floors with randomized twists to keep every run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Status Effects Galore - Freeze, burn, stun, and poison. Show those enemies who's boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shops!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty options to tailor each run to your skill and mood.</p></li></ul>","developers":["ThatOneUnityDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/2b34544e887308ea94b12e6566441aaa8b7ca472/header.jpg?t=1752243993","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144106,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144106/movie480.mp4?t=1752243505","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144106/movie_max.mp4?t=1752243505"},"name":"Wishlist Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144106/44f00546255e1120262bcd2656593c8588